{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/kitakami_center.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/kitakami_center.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "kitakami_center_before_01_01",
      "hash64": "A013CEC78ED796CE",
      "text": "歡迎來到北上中心！\\n慶典就快要開始囉！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kitakami_center_before_08_01",
      "hash64": "ACF80B1365DFC5FB",
      "text": "說到卡比獸，牠在寶可夢中\\n被分類為瞌睡寶可夢！\\r\\n……看就知道了吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kitakami_center_before_12_01",
      "hash64": "D994668B07B6F842",
      "text": "我們準備了有趣的遊戲喔。\\n等掩面祭開始後，再過來一趟吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_01_01",
      "hash64": "E8BC97C1C2E20735",
      "text": "北上中心正在舉辦掩面祭！\\n乖孩子，壞孩子，通通來玩吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_01_02",
      "hash64": "E8BC94C1C2E2021C",
      "text": "剛才幾個穿著像是寶伴布偶裝的\\n傢伙衝上了樓梯！\\r\\n裡面的人還真是辛苦啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_01_03",
      "hash64": "E8BC95C1C2E203CF",
      "text": "我看到的原來是\\n貨真價實的寶伴啊！\\r\\n早知道我就錄影存證了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_09_01",
      "hash64": "C853E807376B910D",
      "text": "我想買個面具，\\n顧攤位的人卻偏偏不在。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_09_02",
      "hash64": "C853E507376B8BF4",
      "text": "看來顧攤位的人終於回來了。\\n現在我應該可以買到面具了吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_10_01",
      "hash64": "012A6BEF121A6243",
      "text": "有好多好多面具！\\n要選哪個好呢～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_10_02",
      "hash64": "012A6CEF121A63F6",
      "text": "戴了皮卡丘的面具，\\n心情也會皮！皮卡丘嗎！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_16_01",
      "hash64": "2A6CB7DEA1A36565",
      "text": "用扇子搧風很涼快！\\n但手一動就會渾身是汗！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_20_01",
      "hash64": "DA91105C4FABBB26",
      "text": "果然寶伴的面具\\n今年也很受歡迎呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_20_02",
      "hash64": "DA910F5C4FABB973",
      "text": "寶伴還活著！？真的假的啊！？\\n我要不要戴上面具去跟牠們認識一下呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_20_03",
      "hash64": "DA910E5C4FABB7C0",
      "text": "吉雉雞本尊並沒有\\n我想像中的那麼粉紅耶～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_21_01",
      "hash64": "084B1C62B28768BB",
      "text": "願增猿的面具！\\n藍藍的有夠酷～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_21_02",
      "hash64": "084B1D62B2876A6E",
      "text": "啥！？\\n寶伴牠們真的存在！？\\r\\n我還以為那只是說說而已的故事咧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_21_03",
      "hash64": "084B1E62B2876C21",
      "text": "實際的願增猿臉超藍的！\\n牠該不會是身體不舒服吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_22_01",
      "hash64": "5EB0E46A4DF125C4",
      "text": "戴上面具會讓人覺得\\n自己好像變了一個人對吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_22_02",
      "hash64": "5EB0E76A4DF12ADD",
      "text": "我一直以為鬼的歷史\\n是要讓小孩子乖乖聽話，\\r\\n所以才編出來的故事！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_22_03",
      "hash64": "5EB0E66A4DF1292A",
      "text": "夠讚狗原來是個壞蛋嗎！？\\n那牠哪裡讚了啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_25_01",
      "hash64": "2D0BD44094B817DF",
      "text": "被畫在歷史看板上的\\n那個人類……\\r\\n是寶伴牠們的訓練家嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_31_01",
      "hash64": "A06184872CB35D74",
      "text": "這裡正在舉辦打鬼祭喔！\\n快來玩玩看，爭取豪華獎品吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_55_01",
      "hash64": "C4F2B040AC5B9C36",
      "text": "打鬼祭是一種\\n騎著寶可夢玩的遊戲！\\c\\n沒有寶可夢的人也不用擔心！\\n有已經熱好身的驚角鹿喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
